	"system": {
		"description": {
			"value": "<p>You've become very good at navigating your environment and tracking other creatures.</p><ul><li><p>Moving through nonmagical &amp;reference[difficult terrain] (like a crowd, thick foliage, or waist deep water) costs you no extra movement.</p></li></ul><p>If your table uses overland travel rules or survival rules, you gain the following benefits as well.</p><ul><li><p>&amp;reference[Difficult terrain] doesn't slow your group's overland travel with you to lead them.</p></li><li><p>Even when you are engaged in another activity (such as foraging, navigating, or tracking), you remain alert to danger.</p></li></ul>",
